B.ZT=s(["Karakum Diyar\u0131nda kervansaray gelirleri 2 kat\u0131na (2x) \xe7\u0131kar."],t.s)
B.UY=s(["Caravanserai revenue is doubled in the Karakum Realm."],t.s)
